L141: For domain collaborative pairs $\mathcal{D}_{\text{dc}}$, we utilize user historical behaviors to enhance collaborative signal awareness. Items frequently co-occurrence by users tend to exhibit both semantic and geographic similarity (cite65†Zhang et al. 2024a ). Specifically, the co-occurrence score is defined in Eq. cite77†5 .
